 #05073b; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Ubuntu, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, PingFang SC, Hiragino Sans GB, Microsoft YaHei UI, Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans CN, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">理，但不保证一定能满足投诉者的要求。<span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium;\">小蓝零工</span>有权决定</span></span><span style=\"color: #05073b; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Ubuntu, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, PingFang SC, Hiragino Sans GB, Microsoft YaHei UI, Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans CN, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">是否向公众或向被投诉者公开投诉内容。对于投诉内容侵犯</span></span><span style=\"color: #05073b; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Ubuntu, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, PingFang SC, Hiragino Sans GB, Microsoft YaHei UI, Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans CN, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">用户隐私权、名誉权等合法权益的，所有法律责任由投诉者</span></span><span style=\"color: #05073b; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Ubuntu, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, PingFang SC, Hiragino Sans GB, Microsoft YaHei UI, Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans CN, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">承担，与<span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium;\">小蓝零工</span>无关。</span></span></p>\n<p id=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 14px 0px 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei UI\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans CN\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #05073b;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-weight: 600;\">八、争议解决</span></p>\n<ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 30px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style-position: outside; list-style-image: none; margin: 14px 0px 1em; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei UI\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans CN\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #05073b;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: inherit; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: PingFang-SC-Regular; line-height: 1.7; position: relative;\">\n<p id=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; line-height: 1.7; display: inline;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei UI\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans CN\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\' !important; font-weight: 600;\">友好协商</span>：平台方和平台使用方在履行本协议过程中如发生争议，应首先通过友好协商解决。</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: inherit; margin: 6px 0px 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: PingFang-SC-Regular; line-height: 1.7; position: relative;\">\n<p id=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; line-height: 1.7; display: inline;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei UI\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans CN\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\' !important; font-weight: 600;\">法律途径</span>：如协商不成，任何一方均有权向平台所在地人民法院提起诉讼解决争议。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p id=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 14px 0px 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei UI\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans CN\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #05073b;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-weight: 600;\">九、其他</span></p>\n<ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 30px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style-position: outside; list-style-image: none; margin: 14px 0px 1em; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei UI\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans CN\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #05073b;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: inherit; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: PingFang-SC-Regular; line-height: 1.7; position: relative;\">\n<p id=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; line-height: 1.7; display: inline;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei UI\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans CN\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\' !important; font-weight: 600;\">协议修改</span>：平台有权根据业务发展和法律法规变化对本协议进行修改。修改后的协议将在平台上公示，用户继续使用平台服务即视为接受修改后的协议。</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: inherit; margin: 6px 0px 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: PingFang-SC-Regular; line-height: 1.7; position: relative;\">\n<p id=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; line-height: 1.7; display: inline;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei UI\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans CN\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\' !important; font-weight: 600;\">协议生效</span>：本协议自用户点击&ldquo;同意&rdquo;并完成注册之日起生效，对双方均具有法律约束力。</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: inherit; margin: 6px 0px 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: PingFang-SC-Regular; line-height: 1.7; position: relative;\"><strong>免责声明</strong>：<span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium;\">小蓝零工</span>不承担因参与零工活动各方因业务调整给您可能带来的损失。您在同意本协议和确认使用本平台服务时应确认，平台仅提供相关信息服务，不与您形成任何形式的劳务法律关系，不承担实际零工活动中所产生的任何损失以及任何费用。</li>\n</ol>', null, '3', '1', 'admin', '2022-08-21', 'admin', '2025-04-03', 'A01', null);
INSERT INTO `cms_articles` VALUES ('1561194952066277377', '联系我们', '1561192720541360130', null, null, null, null, null, '<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;当您有任务建议、意见、投诉、未成年人个人信息相关问题或特定情景下的合理诉求，可通过以下方式联系我们。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;联系电话：18115470673</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;电子邮箱：public@zhixun99.cn</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;联系地址：浙江省金华市金东区鞋塘办事处广渠街1号10号楼</p>', null, '2', '1', 'admin', '2022-08-21', 'admin', '2024-09-21', 'A01', null);
INSERT INTO `cms_articles` VALUES ('1561195445492588545', '帮助中心', '1561194681529475073', null, null, null, null, null, '<p id=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; font-weight: 400;\">小蓝零工平台概括为以下几个主要步骤和功能：</p>\n<h3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 14px 0px 8px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei UI\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans CN\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; color: #05073b; font-size: 20px; border: none; line-height: 1.7;\">一、注册与登录</h3>\n<ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 30px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style-position: outside; list-style-image: none; margin: 14px 0px 1em; scrollbar-width: none; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; font-weight: 400;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: inherit; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: PingFang-SC-Regular; line-height: 1.7; position: relative;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei UI\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans CN\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\' !important; font-weight: 600;\">注册</span>：用户需要填写相关信息或通过微信账号快速登录。</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: inherit; margin: 6px 0px 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: PingFang-SC-Regular; line-height: 1.7; position: relative;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei UI\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans CN\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\' !important; font-weight: 600;\">登录</span>：使用注册时填写的手机号码+密码或验证码登录，或通过微信账号直接完成登录。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 14px 0px 8px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei UI\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans CN\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; color: #05073b; font-size: 20px; border: none; line-height: 1.7;\">二、身份认证</h3>\n<ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 30px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style-position: outside; list-style-image: none; margin: 14px 0px 1em; scrollbar-width: none; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; font-weight: 400;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: inherit; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: PingFang-SC-Regular; line-height: 1.7; position: relative;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei UI\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans CN\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\' !important; font-weight: 600;\">雇主认证</span>：雇主用户需要提交营业执照、法人身份证等资质文件进行身份认证，以确保招工信息的真实性和合法性。</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: inherit; margin: 6px 0px 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: PingFang-SC-Regular; line-height: 1.7; position: relative;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei UI\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans CN\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\' !important; font-weight: 600;\">零工认证</span>：零工用户需要提交身份证明、技能证书等材料进行身份认证，部分工种还需上传相关职业技能证书后方可接单。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 14px 0px 8px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei UI\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans CN\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; color: #05073b; font-size: 20px; border: none; line-height: 1.7;\">三、信息发布与浏览</h3>\n<ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 30px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style-position: outside; list-style-image: none; margin: 14px 0px 1em; scrollbar-width: none; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; font-weight: 400;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: inherit; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: PingFang-SC-Regular; line-height: 1.7; position: relative;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei UI\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans CN\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\' !important; font-weight: 600;\">招工信息发布</span>：雇主可以在小程序中发布招工信息，包括工种、薪资、工作时间、地点等关键信息，并可选择是否显示联系方式。招工信息会在&ldquo;招工需求&rdquo;或类似板块展示，供零工浏览和申请。</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: inherit; margin: 6px 0px 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: PingFang-SC-Regular; line-height: 1.7; position: relative;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei UI\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans CN\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\' !important; font-weight: 600;\">求职信息发布</span>：零工可以在小程序中发布自己的求职信息，包括技能特长、工作经验、期望薪资等，并设置求职意向和筛选条件。求职信息会在&ldquo;求职信息&rdquo;或类似板块展示，供雇主浏览和选择。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 14px 0px 8px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei UI\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans CN\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; color: #05073b; font-size: 20px; border: none; line-height: 1.7;\">四、接单与派单</h3>\n<ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 30px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style-position: outside; list-style-image: none; margin: 14px 0px 1em; scrollbar-width: none; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; font-weight: 400;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: inherit; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: PingFang-SC-Regular; line-height: 1.7; position: relative;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei UI\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans CN\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\' !important; font-weight: 600;\">接单</span>：零工可以浏览招工信息，并根据自己的技能和兴趣选择合适的订单进行接单。接单后，零工需按照订单要求完成工作任务。</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: inherit; margin: 6px 0px 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: PingFang-SC-Regular; line-height: 1.7; position: relative;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei UI\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans CN\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\' !important; font-weight: 600;\">派单</span>：雇主可以根据零工的信誉评分、技能特长等因素选择合适的零工进行派单。派单后，雇主需与零工保持沟通，确保工作任务顺利进行。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 14px 0px 8px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei UI\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans CN\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; color: #05073b; font-size: 20px; border: none; line-height: 1.7;\">五、支付与结算</h3>\n<ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 30px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style-position: outside; list-style-image: none; margin: 14px 0px 1em; scrollbar-width: none; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; font-weight: 400;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: inherit; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: PingFang-SC-Regular; line-height: 1.7; position: relative;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei UI\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans CN\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\' !important; font-weight: 600;\">支付</span>：引入第三方线上支付结算功能，雇主与零工双方确定的服务报酬将金额转入线上支付平台。雇主支付本次订单劳务费后，资金将托管在平台直至订单完成。</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: inherit; margin: 6px 0px 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: PingFang-SC-Regular; line-height: 1.7; position: relative;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei UI\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans CN\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\' !important; font-weight: 600;\">结算</span>：零工人员完成工作任务并经雇主确认后，线上支付平台将报酬转入零工在平台设立的个人账户。同时，平台提供交易记录和账单查询功能，方便用户随时查看和核对。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 14px 0px 8px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei UI\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans CN\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; color: #05073b; font-size: 20px; border: none; line-height: 1.7;\">六、评价与信誉体系</h3>\n<ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 30px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style-position: outside; list-style-image: none; margin: 14px 0px 1em; scrollbar-width: none; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; font-weight: 400;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: inherit; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: PingFang-SC-Regular; line-height: 1.7; position: relative;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei UI\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans CN\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\' !important; font-weight: 600;\">评价</span>：任务完成后，雇主和零工可以互相评价对方的服务质量和态度。评价内容将作为信誉评分的重要依据。</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: inherit; margin: 6px 0px 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: PingFang-SC-Regular; line-height: 1.7; position: relative;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei UI\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans CN\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\' !important; font-weight: 600;\">信誉体系</span>：用户的信誉评分会公开展示在个人信息页面，为其他用户提供参考。高信誉评分的用户更容易获得雇主或零工的青睐和信任。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 14px 0px 8px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei UI\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans CN\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; color: #05073b; font-size: 20px; border: none; line-height: 1.7;\">七、其他功能</h3>\n<ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 30px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style-position: outside; list-style-image: none; margin: 14px 0px 1em; scrollbar-width: none; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; font-weight: 400;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: inherit; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: PingFang-SC-Regular; line-height: 1.7; position: relative;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei UI\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans CN\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\' !important; font-weight: 600;\">消息通知</span>：实时通知用户有关工作更新、面试邀请、订单状态变化等信息。</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: inherit; margin: 6px 0px 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: PingFang-SC-Regular; line-height: 1.7; position: relative;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei UI\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans CN\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\' !important; font-weight: 600;\">隐私设置</span>：允许用户控制个人信息的可见性，保护用户隐私。</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: inherit; margin: 6px 0px 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: PingFang-SC-Regular; line-height: 1.7; position: relative;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei UI\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans CN\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\' !important; font-weight: 600;\">用户中心</span>：用户可以管理个人信息、工作记录、支付详情等，方便随时查看和修改。</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: inherit; margin: 6px 0px 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: PingFang-SC-Regular; line-height: 1.7; position: relative;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; margin: 0px; scrollbar-width: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei UI\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Source Han Sans CN\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\' !important; font-weight: 600;\">客服支持</span>：提供在线客服、电话客服或邮箱等联系方式，方便用户在使用过程中遇到问题时及时获得帮助。</li>\n</ol>', null, '6', '1', 'admin', '2022-08-21', 'admin', '2025-04-03', 'A01', null);
INSERT INTO `cms_articles` VALUES ('1742510809823260673', '积分规则', '1742510518948278274', null, null, null, null, null, '<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>积分规则</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;1、积分可通过充值、邀请新用户等方式获取。</p>\n<p><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"> </span>2、积分可用于电话联系消耗、购买道具等。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"> </span>3、更多积分规则将逐步丰富。</span></p>', null, '1', '1', 'admin', '2024-01-03', 'admin', '2024-10-27', 'A01', null);
INSERT INTO `cms_articles` VALUES ('1742511252041314306', '推广规则', '1742510700028964865', null, null, null, null, null, '<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>推广规则</strong></p>\n<p>1、推广可获得积分，积分适用于&ldquo;积分规则&rdquo;中的使用方式。</p>\n<p>2、如您有稳定丰富的渠道资源，请直接联系我们，期待与您一起携手共同发展。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', null, '2', '1', 'admin', '2024-01-03', 'admin', '2024-10-27', 'A01', null);
INSERT INTO `cms_articles` VALUES ('1819634460590219265', '提现规则', '1819634297549234177', null, null, null, null, null, '<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; 1、满100元才能申请提现。</p>\n<p><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">&nbsp; 2、提现账号可填写支付宝信息，支付宝请填写支付宝账号和真实姓名。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">&nbsp; 3、提现申请提交以后两个工作日内后台会进行转账操作。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">&nbsp; 4、审核结果可以在提现记录里面查看，如果审核失败了，基本上上因为账号错误引起。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">&nbsp; 5、节假日审核时间可能会相应的延长，请耐心等待。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', null, '1', '1', 'admin', '2024-08-03', 'admin', '2024-08-03', 'A01', null);
INSERT INTO `cms_articles` VALUES ('1820731669398384641', '安全提醒', '1820731143629795330', null, null, null, null, null, '<pre>&nbsp;</pre>\n<p>&ldquo;小蓝零工&rdquo;是信息发布、撮合平台，不参与招工和找活双方的交易，不对双方的交易纠纷负责。该信息由用户发布，请找活者注意甄别并保护好自己权益，如遇 代付、收费、刷单、传销、充值、押金、诱导购物购车、收培训费等违规行为，请立即向小蓝零工平台投诉举报!</p>\n<pre>&nbsp;</pre>\n<p>&nbsp;招工和找活双方，应自行通过微信、电话录音等书面方式明确交易信息(包括但不限于工资、工时、工期、结算方式、工作要求等)</p>\n<pre>&nbsp;</pre>\n<p>如遇交易纠纷，请优先协商解决，或寻求当地相关部门的帮助(如:劳动纠纷可拨打12333;交易纠纷可向法院起诉;遇诈骗可向当地警方求助)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>切记:对接支付宝/微信/银行卡验证码的都是骗子!</p>\n<pre>&nbsp;</pre>\n<p>小蓝零工在此郑重声明:因找活者未注意到上述风险所导致的任何损失或责任，均由找活者自行承担，<span style=\"text-align: center;\">小智找工</span>对此不承担任何责任。</p>\n<pre>&nbsp;</pre>\n<p>如招工或找活因此给小蓝零工造成其他负面影响，小蓝零工保留追究其法律责任的权利。</p>\n<pre>&nbsp;</pre>\n<p>特此声明!</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', null, '1', '1', 'admin', '2024-08-06', 'admin', '2025-04-03', 'A01', null);
INSERT INTO `cms_articles` VALUES ('1821460293407670273', '实名认证服务协议', '1821459620930715650', null, null, null, null, null, '<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>《<span style=\"text-align: start;\">小蓝零工</span>实名认证&amp;人脸验证服务协议》</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>欢迎使用小蓝零工实名认证&amp;人脸验证服务（以下称&ldquo;本服务&rdquo;），小蓝零工实名认证授权服务协议（以下称&ldquo;本协议&rdquo;）为xxxx有限公司（以下称&ldquo;我们&rdquo;）与用户（以下称&ldquo;您&rdquo;）签订的授权协议。在接受本协议之前，请仔细阅读本协议的全部内容。【特别提示】请您仔细阅读我们提供的《小蓝零工实名认证&amp;人脸验证服务协议》（尤其是本协议黑体加粗的内容）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>一、定义</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>小蓝零工：指<span style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-align: start;\">小蓝零工</span>小程序或APP</span>客户端。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>二、功能说明</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>为保障用户账户的安全，提供更好的服务，小蓝零工在提供部分服务之前，采用身份验证识别核验证功能和人脸识别核身验证功能对用户的身份进行验证，用于验证操作人是否为账户持有者本人，通过实名和人脸识别结果评估是否为用户提供产品或服务。该功能由阿里云和腾讯提供核验数据及技术支持。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>三、授权与许可</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如您点击&ldquo;我已阅读并同意&rdquo;或以其他方式选择接受本协议规则，则视为您在使用身份验证识别和人脸识别服务时，同意并授权小蓝零工及其合作的认证服务机构获取、使用您在申请小蓝零工服务过程中所提供的个人信息（包括姓名、身份证号）及人脸影像数据，并提供给合法存有您信息的第三方合作机构进行比对核验，以核验您的身份。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>特别提示您知悉，小蓝零工使用的是阿里云计算有限公司及其服务供应商蚂蚁区块链科技（上海）有限公司提供的认证服务，如您想要了解认证服务机构如何处理您的个人信息，您可点击可信身份认证个人信息处理规则查阅了解更多信息。如您不同意本协议的任何内容，或者无法准确理解协议内容的解释，请不要进行后续操作。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>四、信息安全声明</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>小蓝零工承诺对您的个人信息严格保密，并基于国家监管部门认可的加密算法进行数据加密传输，数据加密存储。如因不可抗力、计算机黑客袭击、系统故障、通讯故障、电脑病毒、恶意程序攻击及其他不可归因于小蓝零工的情况而导致用户损失的，小蓝零工不承担任何责任。小蓝零工与合作机构签订保密合同，并要求合作伙伴做好用户信息安全保障，承诺尽到信息安全保护义务。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>五、争议解决</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>您已知悉并接受的本协议的成立、生效、履行和解释，均使用中华人民共和国法律。若您与我们因本协议而发生争议，双方应当努力友好协商解决。若协商不成的，任何一方均有权向成都仲裁委员会提起仲裁。</p>', null, '1', '1', 'admin', '2024-08-08', 'admin', '2025-04-03', 'A01', null);
